{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14226450.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226450","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226450","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1422645001:0":{"text":"向こうで争う声が聞こえる。見に行ってみよう。","source_cn":"那边好像有人在争执，我们去看看吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE55EB26A39873F49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"ブライアン","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14226460.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422646001:1":{"text":"どうして、アヒルを逃がしちまったんだ！あんなに気を付けろって言ったじゃないか！","source_cn":"你怎么能让鸭子都跑了呢，我、我不是跟你说好几遍要注意吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C17FAD92F61AD28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422646002:1":{"text":"ご、ごめん……本を読んでたら、つい夢中になっちゃって……","source_cn":"对不起，这本书我一不小心就看入迷了，没注意鸭子们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2AB47F0886B6A1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422646003:1":{"text":"べ、弁償するから！本当にごめんなさい！","source_cn":"我、我赔你吧，真的太对不起了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98570F72466E87BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422646004:1":{"text":"そういう問題じゃないんだよ。あのアヒルたちは、俺のばあちゃんが飼ってるペットなんだ……","source_cn":"不行啊，这些鸭子是我祖母专门养的，只是带来上山放放风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68BA9939E47808F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422646005:1":{"text":"何かあったのか？","source_cn":"出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE34C83E051767FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422646006:1":{"text":"あっ、ブライアン様！実は――","source_cn":"啊，是布莱恩大人！事情是这样的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DAC059B18B73A84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422646007:1":{"text":"今日、アヒルたちを連れて山を散歩してたんですけど、途中で急用ができて、彼女に少しの間、見ていてもらったんです。","source_cn":"我今天带鸭子上山来放风，但刚刚有些急事，就托这位小姐帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE337C94FFF9001","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422646008:1":{"text":"けど、私……本に没頭しちゃって、アヒルを繋いでた紐が切れたことに気付かなくて……","source_cn":"结果我沉迷看书，完全没注意到拴着鸭子的绳子断了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x472F574153371C3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422646009:1":{"text":"なんだか静かになったなぁとは思ったんだけど……彼に呼ばれるまで、アヒルたちがいなくなってるなんて思いもしなくて……","source_cn":"只觉得它们嘎嘎嘎了半天，然后安静下来了——结果还是守卫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00C2D3096EA6B643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422646010:3":{"text":"なるほど。それなら、まだ遠くへは行っていないはずだ。私が方角を確かめるので、あなた方はアヒルたちを連れ戻してくれ。","source_cn":"明白了，鸭子们不会跑得太远，我听一下方向，你们把它赶回来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6039E46FC4DA6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422646011:1":{"text":"ええ！なんでロンロンたちが！？インドラさんにルナーランドを案内するんじゃないんですか？","source_cn":"咦！什么？不是说好带因度厄游览月影乡吗？！为什么还要我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x334C3755161C785F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1422646011":{"text":"ええ！なんでロンロンたちが！？インドラさんにルナーランドを案内するんじゃないんですか？","source_cn":"咦！什么？不是说好带因度厄游览月影乡吗？！为什么还要我们赶鸭子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x334C3755161C785F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422646012:1":{"text":"ルナーランドでの暮らしと、風語りの日常業務を知ってもらうという、私なりの案内の仕方だ。","source_cn":"这是我的导游方式，让诸位见证月影乡居民的真实生活以及我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC479E60514D3ECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422646014:1":{"text":"インドラ殿にも説明しておこう。","source_cn":"因度厄先生，这就是我展现的部分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA937AEA0AED9294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422646015:1":{"text":"風語りである私は、風の音を聞き、エルーナの目を通して、ユグドラシルだけでなく、バドーゾ全域を見張っているのだ。","source_cn":"作为风语者，我聆听风声，并依靠艾洛娜的眼睛观察薄暮丛林...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FD02AACCE6EBC0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422646016:1":{"text":"なるほどな。監視に罪人の逮捕、それから騒動の鎮圧。私も同じような仕事をしていた。","source_cn":"唔，我能理解。监控，以及逮捕，平息事件，这也是我之前的工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568CC3A28571CD4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422646017:1":{"text":"……えっと、全然違う気がするんですが。","source_cn":"……不是，你们两个的工作内容完全不同吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF46819D1C85E8529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422646018:1":{"text":"でも本人はそう思ってないみたい。","source_cn":"但是不知道为什么就说到一起去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C2EA6440B0D3E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422646019:0":{"text":"かみ合ってない会話はおいといて、アヒルを連れ戻しに行きましょう……","source_cn":"还是别让他俩再鸡同鸭讲了，我们赶紧去把鸭子赶回来吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A26F8E1692CC61F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1422646020:1":{"text":"ていうか、そもそも、なんでロンロンたちがアヒルを追いかけることになるんだよ……！","source_cn":"所以话说回来，布莱恩的工作也好，因度厄的工作也罢，为什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3627F70C5A662027","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"これも案内のうちか？","source_cn":"这是导游吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D8B2D4AB5A4625F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"これも案内のうちか？","female":"これも案内のうち？","variant_male_record_index":"73416","variant_female_record_index":"73417","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1422646013:1":{"text":"そうだな。私の仕事は、案内役、揉め事の仲裁、そして地域全体の見張りだ。今、それを同時にこなしている。","source_cn":"确实，导游和为居民解决纠纷以及对整片区域的全面监控都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B47FC47659C461B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"これはもう仕事だよな？","source_cn":"这是工作吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3ED67BC238A39C5D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"これはもう仕事だよな？","female":"これはもう仕事よね？","variant_male_record_index":"73418","variant_female_record_index":"73419","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:焦急的守卫":{"text":"焦っている守衛","source":"焦急的守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:茵巴斯":{"text":"インバース","source":"茵巴斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"ブライアン","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"インドラ","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":6}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14226470.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226470","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422647001:1":{"text":"ありがとう！おかげでアヒルが戻って来たよ！","source_cn":"太好了，谢谢你们，我的鸭子宝贝回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x247514BA66EC68FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422647002:1":{"text":"これからは、なるべく自分で面倒を見るんだな。他人に任せるなら、想定外の問題が起きることも覚悟しておくべきだ。","source_cn":"自己的鸭子还是要自己看好。本该自己完成的责任交给其他人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88101B63AE35B53F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422647003:1":{"text":"はい……今回のことは、アヒルを置いていった俺の責任です……","source_cn":"我明白了，归根结底还是我自己不够上心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB7DB9732792C0CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422647004:1":{"text":"わ、私も、本当にごめんなさい！引き受けたのに、ちゃんとできなくて……","source_cn":"我、我也！真的太不好意思了，接受了别人的委托结果却……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A768E86976DFC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422647005:1":{"text":"そうだな。本を読みたかったのなら、その場で断るべきだった。引き受けた以上、最後まで責任を持つのが筋だ。","source_cn":"是，如果想看书，就不要答应人家；既然答应了，就该负起相...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30F729EEAEB0B47D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422647006:1":{"text":"引き受ける気がない、あるいは引き受けられないのなら、そこで断るのも、立派な責任の示し方だ。","source_cn":"自己不愿或无法承担的责任就干脆拒绝，也是一种负责的表现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9324C7C77B3A1DE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422647007:0":{"text":"分かった。これからは……ちゃんと、真面目にやるようにする！","source_cn":"我知道了，以后无论是许诺还是做事，我都会更认真一些……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74311576B4E84048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422647008:0":{"text":"アヒルとは……なんとも不思議な生き物だな。もっと凶暴かと思ったが、ただガーガー鳴いてるだけとは……意外だった。","source_cn":"鸭子……真是奇怪的生物，我还以为会很凶猛，结果只会嘎嘎叫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56CA74EF6093AE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422647009:0":{"text":"凶暴なアヒルもいますよ！あいつら、おしりをつっついてくるんです！","source_cn":"不，有些鸭子也会啄你的屁股，很凶猛的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF64D0A59FBF1AE30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422647010:0":{"text":"それにしても、あの女性は、もっと重い処罰を受けるものと思っていたが……","source_cn":"不过，我还以为那位失职的女性会受到更严厉的处罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9041F89C19353E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422647011:0":{"text":"処罰？","source_cn":"处罚？你是指？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9C24C82BC362261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422647012:0":{"text":"所有物を任されるということは、それなりに信頼された部下か、従者なのだろう。だが彼女は、軽率な間違いを犯してしまった。","source_cn":"能被安排照看私人财产，应该是很受重视的部下或者仆从吧。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x841EEB4288896973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422647013:0":{"text":"結果的には、あなたの仲裁もあって男性にほとんど損失はなかったが……それでも、何らかの罰はあると思っていたんだ。","source_cn":"尽管最终而言损失并不大，又有你进行调解，但我以为还是会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE6C41B40558FE04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1422647013":{"text":"結果的には、あなたの仲裁もあって男性にほとんど損失はなかったが……それでも、何らかの罰はあると思っていたんだ。","source_cn":"尽管最终而言损失并不大，又有你进行调解，但我以为还是会有些教训。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE6C41B40558FE04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422647014:0":{"text":"ああ。我々ユグドラシルの住民と制度は、サロクディアと大きく異なるようだな。","source_cn":"是的，我们薄暮丛林的人与制度应当是与萨洛克兰不太一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4089FCF9E0DAA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422647016:0":{"text":"住民と、制度？","source_cn":"人，以及制度？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3187E468BED6700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422647017:1":{"text":"先ほどの二人は、上司と部下でも主と従者でもなく、ただの友人だ。ここでは、私的な問題に公的な法律を持ち出すことはめったにない。","source_cn":"是的，刚才争执的二位只是普通朋友，并非上下级或主仆关系...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5037B813D2AA796F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422647018:1":{"text":"損失が生じたのなら、それ相応の弁済をすればいい。今回は我々がアヒルを連れ戻したので、彼らのわだかまりを解消するだけで済んだ。","source_cn":"如果真的存在损失，那就适当赔偿；但我们已经帮忙挽回损失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB31BDED83891CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422647019:1":{"text":"まあ、仲直りするかどうかは本人たち次第だがな。私はただ、両者に公平な指摘をしただけだ。","source_cn":"本质上，要不要和好是他们之间的事，我只是公平地批评了双方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD75EDD74C14A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1422647019":{"text":"まあ、仲直りするかどうかは本人たち次第だがな。私はただ、両者に公平な指摘をしただけだ。","source_cn":"本质上，要不要和好是他们之间的事，我只是公平地批评了双方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD75EDD74C14A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422647020:1":{"text":"クインなら、あらゆる手を尽くして二人を仲直りさせただろう。エルロンやライカは助言や共同任務を与えたかもしれないが、無理には介入しなかったはずだ。","source_cn":"洛桑会想尽办法使他们重修旧好。埃隆或莱卡会给些建议或安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACCE5A6D8FFE16B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1422647021:1":{"text":"パリーサは私とやり方は近いが、考え方は少し違う。私は人間関係は個人の問題で、必要以上に踏み込むべきではないと思っている。","source_cn":"我和帕瑞莎处理方式相似，只是思路不同。我认为人际关系是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6209EA35FFC5F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1422647022:1":{"text":"いずれにせよ、こうした個人間の揉め事で重い処罰が下されることはめったにない。","source_cn":"总而言之，在私人纠纷这方面，通常都不会处理得太严格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB171C4CA0141F9EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1422647023:0":{"text":"なら、法に触れるような事案に発展した場合はどうなるんだ？","source_cn":"那么，如果上升到公共事务层面呢？","s